title Caravan hear -- a correction is finished when its reader answers, in their own hand
prompt Keaton asked the loop to be Kyri in Radiant Style, read the operator card and the itineraries, pick up the running thread from the newest log's recommend, close open agent-closable reds first, take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, deep-read one council-rota doc, and send each finished increment as its own signed round.
think Standfast first: crux/REDS.md carries 97 rows and the two newest, %96 and %97, both read CLOSED. No agent-closable red stands open, so the constructive queue is honestly free.
think The running thread is the Caravan arc's own question, asked by the courier rung's recommend line: the delivery proves the letter left, never that anybody opened it, and it asks whether a record should ever wait for the reader's own hand to answer. That is the crux, and it is agent-doable whole.
think Named the rung hear rather than acknowledge, under the Comlink tendency -- the arc's rungs are single warm verbs (mend, reckon, bear, appraise, recant, amend, courier), and hear is the plainest word for what it does. Notes live in caravan/.hearings; the reader's box stays caravan/.readers, since the box belongs to the reader rather than to any one rung.
think The shape that made the lap honest: a run may write the letter and may never write the answer. caravan/.readers/desk.told is the plan's hand; caravan/.readers/desk.said is the reader's. The supervisor reads the second and never creates it, and the selftest harness names itself as the reader when it stands one up -- an acknowledgement a supervisor can write for its reader is the plan agreeing with the plan.
think The reader's hand is seated before the run, exactly as the standing appraisal, reading, and address are, since a hand arrives in a box whether the person answered a minute ago or a season ago. That keeps the two runs identical in every act and different only in whether the plan listens.
think Council rota, lap index 61 mod 27 = 7: deep-read foundations/20260813-142420_mycelium-the-consensus-protocol.md. Its voucher law governed this rung directly -- a reading is never lifted off the order it was true for -- and became hand_agrees: a hand naming the reading the letter carries is agreement, and a hand naming any other reading is a different sentence entirely.
obs The finding parts from the courier rung on what it weighs. Every rung below answers a reader who returns or measures the distance to one who does not; this one weighs the record against the reader's own hand, and finds that a plan can deliver perfectly and still learn nothing about the person it corrected.
obs The price is one read of a file the run already knew the name of. Both runs take up 6 phases, absorb 3, lose 3, take the same judgment back, re-seat the same 3, post the same correction, carry it to the same reader, spend the same 6 dependents, and settle carried either way. Only the listening moves.
obs The compiler named a shadow again, and again it was right: answer_as_reader's parameter holds collided with the file-scope holds that publishes a conferral's depth. Renamed to now_holds rather than left as one word meaning two things inside one module.
obs Five RED paths proven on metal before any GREEN claim. The fifth is a planted control worth naming: with the agreement check disarmed and a hand planted naming the superseded reading, the run reports its reader agreeing to a word they never wrote. Seeing that once is what makes HearMisheard a check rather than decoration.
obs Registered the rung in the choir in the same round, per REDS %81's lesson -- a witness on disk that no suite sings is a loom that fires unheard. The Caravan choir now sings 62 per-rung witnesses in one voice, roster bijection whole.
loom witness=caravan_hear_witness phases=6 dependents=6 heard=1 unheard_before=1 unheard_after=0 reds_proven=5 choir_rungs=62
file caravan/hear.rye the rung -- the Receipt word at the plan, four refusals by name, the reader's hand read and never written
file tools/caravan_hear_witness.rish the proof on metal -- the fold, the lap, both halves of the reader's own box read outside the run
file tools/caravan_suite_witness.rish registers the new rung so the choir hears it; 62 witnesses, roster bijection GREEN
file caravan/README.md the durable record of what the rung means, beside the courier rung it answers
file .gitignore the hearings note dir joins its siblings as run residue rather than tracked state
file crux/REMEMBER.md the live edge moves to the hearing, and the git nib follows in the same commit
recommend keep-going the arc has answered for reach at every moment of a dependent's life, repaired what a fall cost, weighed the losses nobody spoke to, taken back its own stale judgments, written to the reader those judgments misled, carried that letter to where the reader is, and now reads what that reader answered back -- so the question standing above it is what a plan owes a reader who answers something other than agreement: this rung refuses a hand that names a different reading, which is honest and entirely silent about what that reader actually meant, and asks whether a record should ever hold a disagreement it cannot resolve.
